OL,3,GNEWSAFriends of Harvey Willgoose tell
OL,4,Aof 'massive' impact of stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FFriends of murdered teenager Harvey
OL,7,FWillgoose say their lives have been
OL,8,F"broken" since his death.
OL,10,FHarvey, 15, was stabbed by Mohammed
OL,11,FUmar Khan in front of children and
OL,12,Fteachers at All Saints Catholic High
OL,13,FSchool in Sheffield in February 2025.
OL,15,FKhan, also 15, was found guilty of
OL,16,Fmurder and detained for a minimum of 16
OL,17,Fyears.
OL,19,FA year on from Khan's sentencing, his
OL,20,Ffriends say their lives will never be
OL,21,Fthe same again.
